Package: transposition
Type: Package
Title: Transposition Matrix T_ij
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Joëlle Sonia", "Yanou Nana",
           email = "joellesoniayanounana@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds the transposition matrix T_ij = I_n - E_ii - E_jj +
    E_ij + E_ji, swaps rows or columns of square and non-square matrices,
    checks the properties of T_ij, ranks zones by priority with a
    sequence of swaps, and provides an interactive Shiny application.
